    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Ticket enrichment with Evaluate\nOne **Evaluate** call asks five questions about the same ticket at once:\n- `is_urgent`, `wants_refund`, `legal_threat` (Noul → probability)\n- `team` (Choice → option + confidence)\n- `frustration` (Score → position on 4 levels + confidence)\n\nThe answers land in `answers.<id>`. A Code node then applies the business rules, and a Switch routes the ticket.",
        "height": 196,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -16,
        320
      ],
      "id": "412bc2d2-6c1d-4ceb-bf4c-bdcf9b26f84c",
      "name": "Sticky Note eb19"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why Evaluate instead of several Route nodes?\nRoute picks a path *per question*. Evaluate returns every signal together, so rules can combine them (e.g. urgent **and** frustrated → P1) and thresholds stay in one place.",
        "height": 102,
        "width": 416,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
